Theorem PL-2: Pipeline ordering — analyze before realize

  Preconditions:
    - Pipeline P per Annex E §AIMS (Steps 1-12)
    - Step 4 = analyze_function() produces converged AimsStateMap
    - Step 5 = realize_rc_reuse() consumes AimsStateMap to emit
      RC + reuse + arg_ownership
    - Step ordering per Annex E §AIMS PL-2:
        Step 4 SHALL precede Step 5

  Soundness property:
    Forall function F in pipeline P.
      Step 5 (realize_rc_reuse) on F reads AimsStateMap produced by
      Step 4 (analyze_function) on F;
      executing Step 5 BEFORE Step 4 produces undefined behavior
      (stale or absent state map per PL-5).

  Proof obligation:
    Structural induction over pipeline P's 12-step sequence:
      Base case: Step 1 (analyze_program, interprocedural).
        Per PL-1, runs once across all functions before any
        per-function step; produces MemoryContract per function;
        post-condition: contracts available for all callees of any F.
      Inductive step from Step k to Step k+1, k in [1, 11]:
        Assume Step k completed with post-condition P_k;
        Step k+1 reads Step k's post-condition (input contract);
        per PL-5, no step relies on stale summaries.

    Case analysis on Step 5's preconditions:
      Case Step 4 ran on F:
        AimsStateMap M_F available; M_F.block_exit_states,
        M_F.block_entry_states, M_F.borrow_sources, M_F.events,
        M_F.scalars, M_F.immortals all populated;
        Step 5's emit_rc, emit_reuse, emit_arg_ownership all
        consume M_F entries; soundness preserved.
      Case Step 4 did NOT run on F:
        M_F absent; Step 5 cannot dispatch; sequencing bug per
        PL-5 (state-map-driven emission requires the state map).

    Case analysis on Step 4a (verify_trmc_soundness):
      Per Annex E §AIMS + PL-10, Step 4a runs after Step 4
      on each F; on failure, rolls back to pre-TRMC IR AND
      re-runs Steps 3-4 on restored CFG (PL-5: no stale summaries);
      Step 5 reads the FINAL post-rollback AimsStateMap;
      no stale-summary leak.

    Engines dispatched:
      structural_induction (12-step pipeline sequence + per-step
                            post-condition propagation)
      case_analysis (Step 5's preconditions + Step 4a rollback paths)

  Expected:
    status: unimplemented_engine_shape
    reason: PL-shape scaffold-time; engine implementation pending
